# ART-SOV07 -- W3-FIX-A art acceptance. SOV07 (SNOW, night .46): snow cottages; the invisible lamp posts are not drawn and light the village.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign SOV07S.MAP Nod
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
assert art.invisible >= 4
cheat view_building CAEUR1
wait 2
shot cottages
cheat view_building INYELWLAMP
wait 2
shot lamps
